description:
Implement a `useFetchSimple` hook that fetches data from `url` on mount and returns `{ data, loading, error }`. Use the Fetch API. Assume `url` does not change after mount.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { data, loading, error } = useFetchSimple<User[]>('/api/users');
if (loading) return <Spinner />;
```

